<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>DESCONEXO - 3D Browser MVP</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <canvas id="game"></canvas>
  <div id="vignette"></div>
  <div id="crosshair">+</div>
  <div id="prompt"></div>
  <div id="objective"></div>
  <div id="status"></div>
  <div id="subtitle"></div>
  <div id="startScreen" class="panel visible">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="eyebrow">3D BROWSER MVP</div>
      <h1>DESCONEXO</h1>
      <p>Explore the house, recover the key, descend to the living room, and survive the first distortion.</p>
      <p class="controls"><b>WASD</b> move Â· <b>Mouse</b> look Â· <b>E</b> interact Â· <b>Esc</b> release mouse</p>
      <button id="startButton">ENTER THE HOUSE</button>
      <button id="resetButton" class="secondary">RESET SAVE</button>
      <p class="small">Headphones recommended. This prototype uses simple geometric placeholder art.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="note" class="panel">
    <div class="card note-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">DIARY PAGE</div>
      <h2>12/03/11</h2>
      <p>The day was good. We went to the cinema, had dinner and enjoyed the day together. I wish he also enjoyed spending time with us. Sometimes he seems so distant, almost as if he does not care about us.</p>
      <p>Despite everything, the cinema and dinner were excuses to get him to the doctor. The medication was increased. The doctor said the negative effect should not be too great. I hope that is true.</p>
      <button id="closeNote">CLOSE</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="album" class="panel">
    <div class="card album-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">WEDDING ALBUM</div>
      <div class="photo"><span>DEMON</span></div>
      <p>A blood-stained photograph. A clearly visible brass key is fixed beside it.</p>
      <button id="takeKey">TAKE THE KEY</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="https://cdn.babylonjs.com/babylon.js"></script>
  <script src="game.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

